# ─── YouTube Cookies ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Paste your YouTube cookies here in Netscape format to bypass bot detection.
#
# How to get them (2 minutes):
#   1. Install "Get cookies.txt LOCALLY" Chrome/Firefox extension
#   2. Open a private/incognito window and sign into YouTube (use a throwaway account)
#   3. On youtube.com, click the extension → Export → copy all the text
#   4. Paste it below as a single line (replace newlines with \n) OR use a multiline value
#
# Refresh these every few weeks if you start seeing "Sign in to confirm" errors.
#
YOUTUBE_COOKIES=""

# ─── App ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
APP_URL="http://localhost:3000"
